---
// about.astro
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Me"
  description="Learn more about my background and skills."
  gradientColor="linear-gradient(45deg, #30E2B9, #4B01BA)"
  Sunset
  Gradient
  pageClass="about-page"
>
  <!-- Main Content Section -->
  <section class="main-content">
    <br />
    <h3>My Journey</h3>
    <br />
    <p>
      Over the last six years, I have significantly upskilled myself in various
      areas, including solutions architecture, system management, and web
      development, while working at RTÉ. During this time, I’ve had the
      opportunity to lead and contribute to several impactful projects. I
      designed and implemented an overtime dashboard using Power BI, developed
      both a Recce Library app and a Vehicle Reservation app using Power Apps,
      and played a key role as the technical lead in the development and
      implementation of our 'Radio Booking System.'
    </p>
    <br />
    <p>
      These experiences have not only enhanced my technical expertise but also
      provided me with a deeper understanding of how to create solutions that
      drive business efficiency. The website you're currently visiting is a
      culmination of my recent work for the Front-End Web Development studio at
      UCD, showcasing my journey and growth as a web developer.
    </p>
  </section>

  <p class="currently-listening">
    <b>Currently listening to:</b>
  </p>
  <iframe
    style="border-radius:12px"
    src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/3wM6RTAnF7IQpMFd7b9ZcL?utm_source=generator"
    width="50%"
    height="175"
    frameBorder="0"
    allowfullscreen=""
    allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
    loading="lazy"></iframe>
</Layout>
